        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KELLY ESTATES are delighted to bring to the market this beautiful apartment in *** IMMACULATE CONDITION THROUGHOUT *** Situated in a very popular and well located development. Number 33 comes to the market in excellent condition throughout with a turn key finish.\r\n\r\nAn ideal opportunity for a wonderful ground floor 2 bedroom apartment in a fantastic location situated in the mature Merrion Hall development with numerous amenities nearby and forms part of a beautifully designed and well balanced development that includes a mix of two and three bedroom homes in a well established residential area.\r\n\r\nThis apartment briefly comprises of hallway to living room/kitchen, two double bedrooms (master en-suite) and family bathroom. Many additional benefits include double glazed windows, gas fired central heating, large private courtyard and parking to name but a few. This extremely convenient location is just a stone throw away from Blackrock Village with all local amenities on your door step, you could not ask for a more central position. Presented in EXCELLENT CONDITION this is an ideal opportunity for those looking for a beautiful home easily accessible to all amenities. \r\n\r\nSituated adjacent to the Quality Bus Corridor (QBC), this location offers numerous and regular bus routes that are literally on your doorstep and the City Centre is only 6.5km away. The villages of Blackrock, Stillorgan, Booterstown, Mount Merrion and UCD Belfield are all a short distance away.\r\n\r\n*Please note as the property is unfurnished we have added two staged photos at the end of the images. \r\n\r\nPlease note: Visit Kelly Estates on Facebook, Instagram or Tiktok for videos of the property. Early interest is expected, be sure to contact Kelly Estates today for further information or to arrange viewing! All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
